spice
* SPICE Netlist for the given schematic

VDD 6 0 DC [value] ; specify VDD value
IREF 5 0 DC [value] ; specify IREF value
R1 5 4 R1_value ; specify R1 resistance value

M1 4 4 1 1 NMOS_model ; NMOS: Drain, Gate, Source, Body (connected to Source)
M2 3 4 2 2 NMOS_model ; NMOS: Drain (Iout), Gate, Source, Body (connected to Source)

.end